<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Slip</h1>
<p>Skill
Class: Thief (guild level 15)
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>slip &lt;item&gt; to &lt;someone&gt;
</pre>
<p>Example:
</p>
<pre>slip note to Gandalf
</pre>
<p>Hands something to someone secretly: they know what you gave them, but 
nobody else in the room should notice. It costs a little endurance, and 
you must be standing.
</p><p>Your skill and dexterity decide it. Fumble, and the item slips from your 
hands to the floor, for all to see. Even when it works, other players 
in the room may spot it: each of them gets a chance, against their own 
dexterity and skill at slipping, and immortals always see. You can't slip 
anything to someone whose hands are full, or who can carry no more.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Plant</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Give</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Thief Skills</a>
</pre>




</div>